{
  "_note": "Sample story events for the Southern Flank (ENGINE.md 3.4, CAUCASUS.md 3-4). Copy the \"story\" block into the campaign config. Every event is set off by something players or the AI do, never by a clock; each fires once per round unless it has \"repeat\" (a cooldown in seconds). Objective names are the mission's (CAUCASUS.md 2.1) and action names must match the campaign's \"actions\": rename them to fit. Placeholders in text: {by} (who caused it), {objective}, {side}, {enemy}. Keys starting with _ are notes and are ignored.",
